        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00286:alt:fig-00001-alt",
          "text": "The reaction shows cyclohexanone and pyrrolidine, yielding 1-pyrrolidinocyclohexene (eighty-seven percent) and water. The cyclohexene ring is connected to the pyrrolidine nitrogen atom through a single bond, in the structure."
        },
