        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00286:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "The reaction shows cyclohexanone with pyrrolidine to form enamine in step one. The enamine reacts with 3-buten-2-one (step two), giving intermediates which, on hydrolysis, produce 1,5-diketone (seventy-one percent) and pyrrolidine."
        },
